# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit a real key.

# Optional. A free Google Books API key gives the app its own daily quota
# (keyless requests share one that is often exhausted). Create it in Google
# Cloud: new project -> enable "Books API" -> Credentials -> API key, then
# restrict the key to the Books API. Leave empty to use Open Library only.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=
